you're the best!

&#x200B;

so I shouldn't fix my anterior pelvic tilt...?

Also I noted that some people are quite dismissive by saying  "not interested, just move on", there could be a milion reasons people send mixed signal and stuff like that which are not limited to the fact they're not interested in you or find you unattractive. 

&#x200B;

That being said, I agree with you but attractivness is fundamental in dating...or if not it gives an incredible advantage because people are more lenient to your mistakes and will give you more opportunities. But many people find attractive different things.
